  r1,"demand-yaml-supports-unquoted-placeholders","demand YAML 文本包含 `outputs.0.container.path: {{ output_path }}` 形式的未加引号占位符","调用方执行 `compile(..., options=RunOptions(..., template_vars={\"output_path\": \"./output/report.xlsx\"}))`",系统 MUST 先完成模板渲染再进行 YAML parse
  r1,"workflow-yaml-fields-can-be-templated","workflow YAML 文本包含 `workflow.options.max_concurrency: {{ max_concurrency }}`","调用方执行 `run_workflow(..., options=RunOptions(..., template_vars={\"max_concurrency\": 3}))`",workflow 配置加载 MUST 先完成模板渲染再进行 YAML parse
